# Debian packages that every Gatehouse update installs on the machine, one per line.
# Updates install these before the new Gatehouse program, so a feature that needs extra
# software (high availability, threat detection, application identification) can arrive as an
# ordinary update with no reinstall. Names must be exact Debian 13 package names.
# Leave a package out of this list until a release actually needs it.
ieee-data
openssh-server
keepalived
conntrackd
iputils-arping
